# automatic translation
#: man-adddebug.1.docbook:35
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>adddebug</command> modifies the <filename>Makefile</filename> in "
"the current directory (and optionally in its subdirectories) to add debug "
"info (<option>-g3</option>). It will also remove optimisations "
"(<option>-O[1-9]</option>)."
msgstr ""
"<command>adddebug इति</command> परिवर्तनं करोति<filename> "
"मेकफाइल</filename> वर्तमाननिर्देशिकायां (वैकल्पिकरूपेण च तस्य "
"उपनिर्देशिकासु) debug info (<option value=-g3> -छ3</option> ). अनुकूलनानि "
"अपि दूरीकरिष्यति (<option value=-O[11-99]> -ओ[१-९] ९.</option> )."

# automatic translation
#: man-adddebug.1.docbook:40
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "This utility is part of the &kde; Software Development Kit."
msgstr "एषा उपयोगिता &kde; सॉफ्टवेयर विकास किट।"

# automatic translation
#: man-adddebug.1.docbook:45
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "विकल्पाः"

# automatic translation
#: man-adddebug.1.docbook:49
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-k</option>"
msgstr "<option value=-k>-क</option>"

# automatic translation
#: man-adddebug.1.docbook:50
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keep optimisations (do not remove <option>-O[1-9]?</option> flags which are "
"removed by default)."
msgstr ""
"अनुकूलनानि स्थापयन्तु (न निष्कासयन्तु<option value=-O[11-99]?> "
"-ओ[1-9]?</option> ध्वजाः ये पूर्वनिर्धारितरूपेण निष्कासिताः भवन्ति)।"

# automatic translation
#: man-adddebug.1.docbook:54
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-r</option>"
msgstr "<option value=-r>-र</option>"

# automatic translation
#: man-adddebug.1.docbook:56
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Recursively search through all subdirectories of the current directory and "
"operate on every <filename>Makefile</filename> that is found."
msgstr ""
"वर्तमाननिर्देशिकायाः सर्वासु उपनिर्देशिकासु पुनरावर्तनीयरूपेण अन्वेषणं "
"कुर्वन्तु तथा च प्रत्येकं <filename>Makefile</filename> यत् प्राप्यते "
"तस्मिन् कार्यं कुर्वन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: man-adddebug.1.docbook:60
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-n</option>"
msgstr "<option value=-n>-न</option>"

# automatic translation
#: man-adddebug.1.docbook:61
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"compile without NDEBUG and NO_DEBUG being defined (makes "
"<function>kDebug</function> calls work)"
msgstr ""
"NDEBUG तथा NO_DEBUG परिभाषितं विना संकलनं कुर्वन्तु "
"(<function>kDebug</function> आह्वानं कार्यं करोति)"